  m_Name: Devil's Charged Sniper Rifle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WeaponScriptableObject
  weaponName: Devil's Charged Sniper Rifle
  weaponDescription: A sniper variant, harnesses the power of the Mites for devastating
    firepower. Functions using the heart of a Mite rather than a supercharged battery
    - a Mites heart is extremely efficient at carrying and distributing plasma energy,
    allowing this sniper to produce more power then ever before. The produced energy
    is stored into a plasma sac also taken from a Mite, necessary to store such as
    large amount of condensed energy.
